  "an1.82:1.1": "Nāhaṃ bhikkhave aññaṃ ekadhammam pi samanupassāmi yo evaṃ mahato anatthāya saṃvattati yathayidaṃ bhikkhave pamādo. ",
  "an1.82:1.2": "Pamādo bhikkhave mahato anatthāya saṃvattatī ",
  "an1.82:1.3": "ti. 3. ",
  "an1.83:1.0": "",
  "an1.83:1.1": "Nāhaṃ bhikkhave aññaṃ ekadhammam pi samanupassāmi yo evaṃ mahato atthāya saṃvattati yathayidaṃ bhikkhave appamādo. ",
  "an1.83:1.2": "Appamādo bhikkhave mahato atthāya ",
